            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">Section Scores (200–800 each)</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Reading &amp; Writing and Math are each scored 200–800. Both sections are weighted equally in the composite total.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 font-bold font-heading flex-shrink-0">3</div>
