              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">Percentile Rank</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Shows what percentage of students nationally you scored higher than. A 90th percentile means you outscored 90% of test-takers.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-amber-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-amber-700 font-bold font-heading flex-shrink-0">4</div>
